knob:
METHOD: Add this snippet to the console (or bookmarklet). It reads `?variant=` from the URL; if the value is `b`, it adds a class `variant-b` to `<body>`. You can pre‑define alternative styles in a `<style>` block (e.g., change hero background colour).
```js
(() => {
const v = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('variant');
if(v === 'b') document.body.classList.add('variant-b');
})();
```

